sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User/Merchant
  participant A as API
  participant C as ApiController
  participant DB as Database
  participant P as PointsService
  participant R as ReferralService
  U->>A: POST /affiliate/click
  A->>C: validate and trackClick
  C->>DB: create Click; increment Link
  C-->>U: click_id + affiliate_url
  U->>A: POST /affiliate/conversion
  A->>C: reportConversion
  C->>DB: create Conversion + Commission
  C->>P: creditCashback
  C->>R: creditReferralPoints
